From 1fad60dc4c8b7c24d9f5e3acd5e266306743cb44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:37:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] Add bisub package: streaming LLM bilingual subtitle
 pipeline

Self-contained package (org.schabi.newpipe.bisub) with no new gradle
dependencies:
- BisubManager: single-instance translation orchestrator with manual
  button-triggered mode, progress callbacks and a completed-only cache
- VttParser: WebVTT parsing, rolling-window cue de-overlap and the
  original/translation composition (single-line joined text, two lines
  per cue)
- SubtitleTranslator: JSON-batch translation with retry-backfill of
  missing lines, executor pool and a wall-clock budget
- BisubPrefs + BisubStyle: 7-field in-app subtitle style
- BisubSubtitleView: self-drawn subtitle view (StaticLayout text +
  rounded background), fixed-width container layout model, auto-shrink
  against unbreakable tokens and true-ratio preview support

Adapted from the NewPipe bisub patch series: the subtitle candidate
filter is inlined (PipePipe's ListHelper has no
getUrlAndNonTorrentStreams).
